                <div class="lb-expansion-panel__surface-content">
                  <p>
                    NFL Sunday Ticket is a premium out-of-market sports package
                    that broadcasts all out-of-market regular season Sunday
                    National Football League games not available on your local
                    broadcast in your area (NBC, CBS or FOX affiliate). NFLST
                    excludes digital only games. NFLST is not available for
                    commercial usage. This means it's intended for private homes
                    and apartments. For example, if you're a Dallas Cowboys fan
                    but live in Miami, you'd be able to watch all of the Sunday
                    Cowboys games that aren't shown on NBC, CBS or FOX in your
                    local market.
                  </p>
