        "mainEntity": [
          {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "What is NFL Sunday Ticket and what games are included?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "@type": "Answer",
              "text": "<p>NFL Sunday Ticket is a premium out-of-market sports package that broadcasts all out-of-market regular season Sunday National Football League games not available on your local broadcast in your area (NBC, CBS or FOX affiliate). NFLST excludes digital only games. NFLST is not available for commercial usage. This means it's intended for private homes and apartments. For example, if you're a Dallas Cowboys fan but live in Miami, you'd be able to watch all of the Sunday Cowboys games that aren't shown on NBC, CBS or FOX in your local market.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://support.google.com/youtubetv/answer/15138104\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">See what remaining NFL games are included with each plan</a></p>"
            }
          },
          {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "What NFL teams can I watch on NFL Sunday Ticket?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "@type": "Answer",
              "text": "<p>NFL Sunday Ticket provides access to every out-of-market Sunday regular season game, encompassing all 32 NFL teams. This means you can watch any team, from the AFC like the Buffalo Bills, Kansas City Chiefs, and Baltimore Ravens, to the NFC such as the Dallas Cowboys, Green Bay Packers, and Tampa Bay Buccaneers. You'll have access to every Sunday afternoon game not locally broadcast in your area. This includes:</p>\n<p>Arizona Cardinals | Atlanta Falcons | Baltimore Ravens | Buffalo Bills | Carolina Panthers | Chicago Bears | Cincinnati Bengals | Cleveland Browns | Dallas Cowboys | Denver Broncos | Detroit Lions | Green Bay Packers 1 | Houston Texans | Indianapolis Colts | Jacksonville Jaguars | Kansas City Chiefs | Las Vegas Raiders | Los Angeles Chargers 2 | Los Angeles Rams | Miami Dolphins | Minnesota Vikings | New England Patriots | New Orleans Saints | New York Giants | New York Jets | Philadelphia Eagles | Pittsburgh Steelers | San Francisco 49ers | Seattle Seahawks | Tampa Bay Buccaneers | Tennessee Titans | Washington Commanders</p>"
            }
          },
          {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "Do I need NFL Sunday Ticket to see my favorite teams?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "@type": "Answer",
              "text": "<p>The first initial weeks of the NFL season can be the most exciting for a fan - the NFL has finally returned and every team starts with the same record! But did you know that during the first four weeks of the season, 94% of teams tend to have games on CBS and FOX that are shown in less than half of the country? With NFL Sunday Ticket and YouTube TV, you can be sure you&rsquo;ll be able to see those games, no matter where you live in the US. Even fans of the Cowboys, Chiefs, Eagles, Packers, 49ers, Lions, (and fans of every other team!) have needed NFL Sunday Ticket to ensure they could watch every regular season game of their favorite team along with a live TV service like YouTube TV.</p>"
            }
          },
          {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "What NFL conferences are covered with NFL Sunday Ticket?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "@type": "Answer",
              "text": "<p>NFL Sunday Ticket covers both AFC (American Football Conference) and NFC (National Football Conference). This means you can watch every out-of-market Sunday game from all teams in both conferences,</p>\n<p>Including:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>AFC East</li>\n<li>AFC North</li>\n<li>AFC South</li>\n<li>AFC West</li>\n<li>NFC East</li>\n<li>NFC North</li>\n<li>NFC South</li>\n<li>NFC West</li>\n</ul>"
            }
          },
          {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "Can I access NFL Sunday Ticket without a cable plan or live TV subscription?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "@type": "Answer",
              "text": "<p>Absolutely! NFL Sunday Ticket allows you to watch out-of-market Sunday NFL games online without needing a cable or satellite TV subscription. All you need is an internet connection and a compatible device. In the US, you can subscribe through YouTube TV or YouTube Primetime Channels.</p>"
            }
          },
          {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "I don't have cable and want to follow the NFL this season. What are my options?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "@type": "Answer",
              "text": "<p>If you're looking to watch a wide range of NFL games without a cable plan, NFL Sunday Ticket is a great choice. It gives you access to every out-of-market Sunday regular season game, so you can follow multiple teams and catch all the key matchups. <a href=\"https://support.google.com/youtubetv/answer/15138104\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Explore NFL Sunday Ticket packages and find the one that fits your needs</a>.</p>"
            }
          },
          {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "What is NFL RedZone?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "@type": "Answer",
              "text": "<p>NFL Sunday Ticket with NFL RedZone included is an option at checkout to both YouTube TV and YouTube users. NFL RedZone brings you every touchdown, from every game, every Sunday afternoon during the regular season, with 7 hours of live football coverage, featuring up to 8 games at once. NFL RedZone can also be purchased with the NFL RedZone with Sports Plus add on in the YouTube TV onboarding flow or as a standalone add on in YouTube TV.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://support.google.com/youtubetv/answer/13844201\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Learn about NFL Redzone</a></p>"
            }
          },
          {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "What is YouTube TV?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "@type": "Answer",
              "text": "<p><a href=\"https://support.google.com/youtubetv/answer/7069119?sjid=5082629036510608231-NA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">YouTube TV</a> is a subscription streaming service that lets you watch live TV from major broadcast and popular cable networks in English and Spanish. Enjoy local and national live sports, breaking news, and must-see shows the moment they air. Included: unlimited cloud DVR storage space so you can record your favorites, and stream them wherever you go. You also get 6 accounts per household, so share with your family members or roommates.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://support.google.com/youtubetv/answer/13316318\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Learn more about NFL Sunday Ticket</a>.</p>"
            }
          },
          {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "What is the main YouTube TV Plan?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "@type": "Answer",
              "text": "<p>The main YouTube TV plan is <a href=\"https://tv.youtube.com/welcome/?_gl=1*15ciwth*_ga*MTg0NTcyMTY0LjE3NzM3NzkwOTA.*_ga_245KVNTKBQ*czE3NzM4NjU5NDMkbzckZzEkdDE3NzM4NjY1MDAkajU5JGwwJGgw#customize\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">YouTube TV's</a> core live TV offering. It includes 100+ live channels like ABC, CBS, FOX, NBC, and ESPN for more live sports, new, shows, and more. It also includes unlimited DVR space, 6 accounts per household, and other benefits. And for an additional monthly charge, you can always stack your lineup with a few more add-on networks.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://support.google.com/youtubetv/answer/13316318\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Learn more about NFL Sunday Ticket</a>.</p>"
            }
          },
          {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "What plans does YouTube TV offer?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "@type": "Answer",
              "text": "<p>Besides the Sports Plan, there is the main YouTube TV plan ($82.99/mo.), giving you 100+ channels and the widest range of programming. Everything from news and entertainment to local sports. More <a href=\"https://tv.youtube.com/onboard?_gl=1*1xc9i5m*_up*MQ..&amp;gclid=Cj0KCQjwh-HPBhCIARIsAC0p3ce432kY84aeSF-LljJNejNpgwgF7kI6rjsRZBIIyRDyyyOjTKkIsNQaAvhBEALw_wcB&amp;gclsrc=aw.ds\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">genre-based plans</a> available are at different price points! No matter which YouTube TV plan you choose, you get the full premium experience, including:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Unlimited Cloud DVR</li>\n<li>Multiview to watch up to four streams at once</li>\n<li>Up to 6 personal accounts</li>\n<li>Access to all add-ons and premium channels and more!</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Cancel, pause, or switch plans anytime.</p>"
            }
          },
          {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "What stations do you carry in my area?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "@type": "Answer",
              "text": "<p>YouTube TV is a live TV service that carries similar channels as traditional cable or satellite TV (for example NBC, FOX, ABC or ESPN). But unlike those services, it is delivered to your TVs and devices through the Internet. You don't need a satellite dish or other dedicated equipment to use it. All you need is internet and a supported streaming device, which can be on your TV. YouTube TV costs $82.99 per/mo, and NFL Sunday Ticket is an additional charge. If you want to check out what channels YouTube TV has in your area, you can do that <a href=\"https://tv.youtube.com/welcome/#zip-lookup\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"Here the YouTube TV channel lineup available in your area.\">here</a>. If you don&rsquo;t want a new TV service and you are happy with your existing service, you can buy NFL Sunday Ticket by itself from YouTube Primetime Channels. You'll watch the games right in the YouTube app on your supported devices.</p>"
            }
          },
          {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "Will I need a YouTube TV membership to get NFL Sunday Ticket?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "@type": "Answer",
              "text": "<p>No. Having a YouTube TV membership is not required. You can purchase NFL Sunday Ticket by itself with YouTube Primetime Channels-no bundling is required. However, if you bundle NFL Sunday Ticket with YouTube TV, you'll get 100+ live TV channels like ABC, CBS, FOX, NBC, and ESPN for more live sports and local &amp; national NFL games.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://support.google.com/youtubetv/answer/13316318\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Learn more about NFL Sunday Ticket with YouTube TV</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://support.google.com/youtube/topic/16271394\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Learn more about NFL Sunday Ticket standalone purchasing</a></p>"
            }
          },
          {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "What are YouTube Primetime Channels?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "@type": "Answer",
              "text": "<p><a href=\"https://support.google.com/youtube/answer/12769543?sjid=5082629036510608231-NA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">YouTube Primetime Channels</a> offer a way for users to subscribe and watch content from their favorite streaming services right on the YouTube app. With over 30 channels, users can browse, sign up for and watch their favorite shows, movies, sports and more, directly on YouTube. It's the way to watch out-of-market games and NFL RedZone, all within the same YouTube you use today.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://support.google.com/youtubetv/answer/13316318\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Learn more about NFL Sunday Ticket</a>.</p>"
            }
          },
          {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "Will my NFL Sunday Ticket subscription auto-renew?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "@type": "Answer",
              "text": "<p>If you signed up for the NFL Sunday Ticket on YouTube TV or Primetime Channels, your plan is set to automatically renew at full price for the upcoming season. You can check your autorenewal date and cancel your plan renewal anytime before you are charged for the next season. Visit the <a href=\"https://support.google.com/youtubetv/answer/13769266?hl=en&amp;ref_topic=13625337&amp;sjid=17114201391902884271-NA\">YouTube TV</a> or <a href=\"https://support.google.com/youtube/answer/13774540?sjid=2474037182787782183-NC\">Primetime Channel</a> help center articles to learn how.</p>"
            }
          },
          {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "Are monthly payment plans available?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "@type": "Answer",
              "text": "<p>Yes, most viewers will see the option to purchase NFL Sunday Ticket as either a single payment or in up to 8 monthly payments when signing up on the web (desktop &amp; mobile). You will pay the same price for NFL Sunday Ticket whether paying via a single payment or via monthly installment payments.</p><p>Note that viewers in the following states will only have the option to purchase NFL Sunday Ticket via single payment:</p><ul><li>Colorado</li><li>Maine</li><li>Utah</li><li>Wisconsin</li></ul><p>And installment payment plans are not available for viewers in all U.S. territories.</p>"
            }
          },
          {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "Why can’t I see the option to purchase in 8 monthly payments?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "@type": "Answer",
              "text": "<p>This option is currently not available everywhere. For most users, you will see the option to purchase in 8 monthly payments in the coming months. However, users in certain locations will not see this option, specifically, users in Colorado, Maine, Utah, Wisconsin or US territories. <a href=\"https://support.google.com/youtubetv/answer/15137773?p=NFL_Sunday_Ticket_Payments&amp;rd=1&amp;visit_id=639003560018834577-2321660432\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Learn more</a>.</p>"
            }
          },
          {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "How do I purchase NFL RedZone with YouTube TV?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "@type": "Answer",
              "text": "<p>NFL RedZone is available for YouTube TV members to purchase. There are three ways for users to do this:</p>\n<p>If you are signing up for YouTube TV and NFL Sunday Ticket together, you can add the NFL Redzone with Sports Plus add-on for $10.99/month.</p>\n<p>If you already have YouTube TV and want to add NFL RedZone to your plan, you have the option to purchase the NFL Sunday Ticket with NFL RedZone or the NFL RedZone with Sports Plus add-on from your <a href=\"https://tv.youtube.com/settings/subscriptions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Settings page</a>.</p>\n<p>If you already have both YouTube TV and NFL Sunday Ticket (without RedZone), you can add the NFL RedZone with Sports Plus add on for $10.99/month.</p>\n<p>Lastly, if you purchased YouTube TV with NFL Sunday Ticket + NFL RedZone last season and are on an auto-renewing plan, you do not need to purchase it again. You can check your <a href=\"https://tv.youtube.com/settings/subscriptions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">YouTube TV Settings</a> to see your membership status.</p>"
            }
          },
          {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "Will I be able to get NFL RedZone without NFL Sunday Ticket?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "@type": "Answer",
              "text": "<p>Yes, if you have YouTube TV Base Plan, you can also purchase <a href=\"https://support.google.com/youtubetv/answer/10057534\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">NFL RedZone with Sports Plus</a> on YouTube TV for a monthly fee, but it's more cost-effective to get NFL RedZone with NFL Sunday Ticket package.</p>\n<p>Learn more about NFL Sunday Ticket on <a href=\"https://support.google.com/youtubetv/topic/16266349?visit_id=1770113180724288000-1947945390&amp;rd=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">YouTube TV</a> or as a standalone <a href=\"https://support.google.com/youtube/topic/16271394\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Primetime Channel on YouTube</a>.</p>"
            }
          },
          {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "Will I be able to cancel NFL Sunday Ticket/NFL Sunday Ticket with NFL RedZone?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "@type": "Answer",
              "text": "<p>If you purchase a NFL Sunday Ticket package, you can cancel your subscription&rsquo;s <a href=\"https://support.google.com/youtubetv/answer/13769266\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">autorenewal for next season</a> but your current season&rsquo;s subscription is non-cancellable and nonrefundable. Additionally, if you purchase the YouTube TV NFL Sunday Ticket/NFL Sunday Ticket with NFL RedZone package, you must also keep an active YouTube TV subscription until, and throughout, the 2026-2027 NFL season to keep watching NFL Sunday Ticket. <a href=\"https://support.google.com/youtubetv/gethelp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Please contact our Customer Service if you have any additional questions</a>.</p>"
            }
          },
          {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "What is the price for returning NFL Sunday Ticket users, and how do I know if I qualify?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "@type": "Answer",
              "text": "<p>If you have previously purchased NFL Sunday Ticket via YouTube or YouTube TV, you qualify as a returning user. The price for returning users for NFL Sunday Ticket as an add-on to a YouTube TV base plan is also a one-time payment of $378, or 8 non-cancelable monthly payments of $47.25. The price for returning users for NFL Sunday Ticket as a standalone purchase on YouTube is a one-time payment of $480, or 8 non-cancelable monthly payments of $60. The first payment is charged at the time of purchase. Payment plans not available everywhere.</p>"
            }
          },
          {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "Are any discounts available from YouTube for NFL Sunday Ticket?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "@type": "Answer",
              "text": "<p>Yes, we have promotional pricing available to new users who have never purchased or subscribed to NFL Sunday Ticket in the past via YouTube or YouTube TV. We also have discounts available for <a href=\"https://tv.youtube.com/learn/nflsundayticket/studentplan/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">students</a>. You can find all NFL Sunday Ticket offers, deals, and discounts on our <a href=\"https://tv.youtube.com/learn/nflsundayticket/deals/\" target=\"_self\">offers page</a>.</p>"
            }
          },
          {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "Am I eligible for the new user price?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "@type": "Answer",
              "text": "<p>The new user price is available only if you have never purchased or subscribed to NFL Sunday Ticket in the past via YouTube or YouTube TV. This includes previous subscriptions through a YouTube TV bundle. The price for new users for NFL Sunday Ticket as an add-on to a YouTube TV plan is a one-time payment of $240, or 8 non-cancelable monthly payments of $30. The price for new users for NFL Sunday Ticket as a standalone purchase on YouTube is a one-time payment of $240, or 8 non-cancelable monthly payments of $30. The first payment is charged at the time of purchase. Not available everywhere.</p><p>If you’re a returning user, find more information on available discounts below.</p>"
            }
          },
          {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "If I sign up, can I share with family members?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "@type": "Answer",
              "text": "<p>Yes. When you create a Google family group, you can share YouTube TV or access to Primetime Channels with up to 5 other members of your household at no extra cost. Each of you will be able to use your own Google account to log in and access the service once you've set up your family group. <a href=\"https://support.google.com/youtubetv/answer/7251139?hl=en\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Learn how to manage a family group with YouTube TV</a> or with the <a href=\"https://support.google.com/youtube/answer/15456306\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">NFL Sunday Ticket Primetime Channel</a>.</p>"
            }
          },
          {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "What devices are supported?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "@type": "Answer",
              "text": "<p>You can watch NFL Sunday Ticket on YouTube TV on these&nbsp;<a href=\"https://support.google.com/youtubetv/answer/7129767?visit_id=638288444130677992-263304352&amp;p=NFL_Sunday_Ticket_YTV_Devices&amp;rd=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">supported devices</a>.</p>\n<p>You can watch NFL Sunday Ticket on YouTube Primetime Channels on these&nbsp;<a href=\"https://support.google.com/youtube/answer/78358?visit_id=638288444132439115-554885077&amp;p=NFL_Sunday_Ticket_YT_Devices&amp;rd=1#smart_tv\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">supported devices</a>.</p>\n<p>Learn more about NFL Sunday Ticket on <a href=\"https://support.google.com/youtubetv/answer/13316318\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">YouTube TV</a> or as a standalone <a href=\"https://support.google.com/youtube/topic/16271394\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Primetime Channel on YouTube</a>.</p>"
            }
          },
          {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "How many streams do I get?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "@type": "Answer",
              "text": "<p>NFL Sunday Ticket can be watched on unlimited (simultaneous) streams at home and 2 additional streams out of the home for household members on the go.</p>\n<p>For example, you can tune in on your living room TV while a family member watches on their tablet from a different room, and another member watches at the same time on their mobile phone when at home. But outside your home, you can only watch on up to two separate streams.Learn more about NFL Sunday Ticket on <a href=\"https://support.google.com/youtubetv/topic/16266349?visit_id=1770112761030215000-1947945390&amp;rd=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">YouTube TV</a> or as a standalone <a href=\"https://support.google.com/youtube/topic/16271394\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Primetime Channel on YouTube</a>.</p>"
            }
          },
          {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "If I'm a commercial establishment, can I use my NFL Sunday Ticket subscription?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "@type": "Answer",
              "text": "<p>No. NFL Sunday Ticket on YouTube and YouTube TV is exclusively licensed for residential use. This means it's intended for private homes and apartments.</p>\n<p>Commercial establishments, such as bars, restaurants, and stores, are not permitted to use NFL Sunday Ticket unless they obtain specific commercial rights. These commercial rights are not offered through YouTube or YouTube TV. They are available through Everpass Media. For more information, please visit: <a href=\"https://everpass.com/live-sports/nfl-sunday-ticket/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://everpass.com/live-sports/nfl-sunday-ticket/</a></p>"
            }
          },
          {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "What is the chat assistant on this page, and how does it handle my privacy?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "@type": "Answer",
              "text": "<p>When you click on a “chat now” link or the chat banner, you get 24/7, instant support with an AI-powered assistant that can help with plan details, pricing, sign-up options, and more.</p><p>AI responses may be inaccurate and don't reflect YouTube's views. Humans may review chats for quality. Because this chat is available without signing into your Google Account, chat sessions are temporary, and we are unable to retrieve or provide transcripts for specific users. <a href=\"https://support.google.com/helpguide/answer/14185196\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Learn more at the Chat AI Privacy Hub</a>.</p>"
